# bench/cluster node list — one node per line, copy to `nodes` and edit.
#
#   <ssh-target>            [pgport]
#
# ssh-target : whatever `$BENCH_SSH <target>` reaches (a Host in ~/.ssh/config,
#              or user@host). pgbench and psql run there, next to that node's
#              Postgres (BENCH.md §3).
# pgport     : that node's PostgreSQL port. Optional; defaults to $BENCH_PGPORT
#              (5432). The ytserv peer port (7421) is not needed here.
#
# Node order is the shard order: line 1 is `-D node=1`, line 2 is `-D node=2`.
# '#' and blank lines are ignored.

node1   5432
node2   5432
